f"Toy (all 8 physical fault subsets): old {t['old']:.12g}; corrected finite-p second-order {t['exact_second']:.12g}; physical p² coefficient {t['brute_second']:.12g}; brute-force conditional all-orders {t['brute_all_orders']:.12g}; X/Y all-orders {t['xy_all_orders']:.12g}. The factor-of-two failure is reproduced.",'',
